 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey there! How's your day?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Kind of tired, honestly.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.81,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can I use oil instead of butter in a cake? I've run out.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.38,
   "block": "baking.dlg30",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "In most cakes, yes. Use a bit less oil than the butter amount, roughly three quarters.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.12,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "baking.dlg30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Will it taste different?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.23,
   "block": "baking.dlg30",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "You lose the buttery flavour, but oil cakes are often moister and stay soft for longer.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.35,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "baking.dlg30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Unrelated, but It's my dad's seventieth and he wants a birthday walk, but I need to choose where.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.6,
   "block": "hiking.opt4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Listen to all of them first, then comment.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.78,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "describe_options",
   "phrasing": "describe_instr_16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "One idea is the lighthouse loop, it's flat along the cliffs, about four miles, with a cafe at the end.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "block": "hiking.opt4",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Another is the hill behind his old school, a steady climb, quite sentimental for him, about six miles.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 6.02,
   "block": "hiking.opt4",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Or there's the bluebell woods, short and gentle, but it might be muddy this time of year.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 5.83,
   "block": "hiking.opt4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Finished. Thoughts, Moshi?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.08,
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "explicit",
   "phrasing": "describe_cue_v2_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "I'd lean towards his old school hill, a birthday walk with memories is special. Keep the lighthouse loop as a backup if the weather turns, and skip the woods if it's been raining.",
   "est_sec": 10.33,
   "gap_before": 0.48,
   "role": "resume",
   "block": "hiking.opt4"
  }
 ]
